# **WHY THIS ARCHITECTURE?**

## **The 3-Tier Architecture Explained**

Think of a bank building:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│        CORE LAYER (Head Office)                  │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐│
│  │ Where all decisions are made, data flows     ││
│  │ through here. OSPF routing, HSRP redundancy ││
│  │ CORE-R1, CORE-R2, CORE-SW1, CORE-SW2       ││
│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘│
└────────────────┬────────────────────────────────┘
                 │
    ┌────────────┴────────────┐
    │                          │
