## **L2 Switch Configuration Details**

### **ACC-SWx (2960-24TT) - Access Switches 1-6**

**Role:** Pure Layer 2 Switching, NO Routing

**Port Configuration:**
```
GigabitEthernet0/1: Trunk to AGG-SW1
GigabitEthernet0/2: Trunk to AGG-SW2

FastEthernet0/3-24: 
  - Access ports for servers
  - Assigned to appropriate VLAN
  - Shutdown initially (security)
```

**Trunk Configuration:**
```
switchport mode trunk
switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
switchport trunk allowed vlan 10,20,30,40,50,60,70,80,99
no shutdown
```

**Access Port Configuration:**
```
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan [VLAN_NUMBER]
shutdown (initially, no shutdown when server connected)
```

**Unused Port Security:**
```
interface range FastEthernet0/3-24
 switchport access vlan 99  (send to blackhole)
 shutdown                   (disable)
exit
```

**NOTE:** No ip routing, no VLAN SVIs, no OSPF!
These are pure switches - just forward frames.

